  (:source ".asl/mem/decisions/SystemArchitecture.asn:108" :finding "R1-R9 separate measurement validity, orientation, essential ablation, markers, context, review, knowledge, coordination and code navigation. Benefits remain hypotheses; paired uncertainty, total costs, task-specific margins and negative outcomes are explicit.")
